WEBVTT

00:02:28.977 --> 00:02:31.389
for everything we do.

00:02:31.389 --> 00:02:33.858
Using functional magnetic 
resonance imaging,

00:02:33.858 --> 00:02:38.099
scientists have discovered that the brain's 
pruning ability is disrupted

00:02:38.099 --> 00:02:40.771
in people with bipolar disorder.

00:02:40.771 --> 00:02:43.058
That means their neurons go haywire

00:02:43.058 --> 00:02:46.398
and create a network
that's impossible to navigate.

00:02:46.398 --> 00:02:49.228
With only confusing signals as a guide,

00:02:49.228 --> 00:02:53.938
people with bipolar disorder develop
abnormal thoughts and behaviors.

00:02:53.938 --> 00:02:55.558
Also, psychotic symptoms,

00:02:55.558 --> 00:02:57.920
like disorganized speech and behavior,

00:02:57.920 --> 00:02:59.227
delusional thoughts,

00:02:59.227 --> 00:03:00.488
paranoia,